title: One day in Vietnam — cinematic test
format: guide
artstyle: nutshell
voice: af_heart
music: upbeat
# w3 at=street cam=drop time=dawn head="ONE DAY|in Vietnam" dur=4.5
Six in the morning. The city is already awake.
# w3 at=street cam=curb time=dawn head="7 MILLION|motorbikes in Hà Nội" shake=.02
Scooters everywhere. Breakfast is on the curb.
# w3 at=cart cam=push out=push time=dawn tags="cart:25.000 ₫:≈ $1:.9"
First stop: a bánh mì cart. Twenty-five thousand.
# vis kind=build set=banhmi in=zoom parts="pate:PÂTÉ|pork:GRILLED PORK|pickles:PICKLED CARROT|cucumber:CUCUMBER|herbs:CORIANDER|chili:CHILI|sauce:MAGGI" sub="inside a 25k bánh mì" final="25.000 ₫|all of that for $1"
What's inside?
Pâté,
grilled pork,
pickled carrot,
cucumber,
coriander,
chili,
and Maggi. Close it up.
# w3 at=cup cam=orbit act=coffee time=day head="20.000 ₫|iced coffee on a stool"
Mid-morning, the phin drips into the glass.
Ice goes in. Twenty thousand.
# w3 at=hotel cam=push time=day tags="hotel:90.000 ₫:same coffee:1.6" head="THE TRAP|50 metres away"
Fifty metres away, a hotel lobby café.
The same coffee: ninety thousand.
# w3 at=bowl cam=drop act=pho full=1 out=push time=day head="LUNCH|phở on the sidewalk"
Lunch is phở.
# vis kind=build set=pho bg=ember in=zoom parts="broth:BROTH|noodles:RICE NOODLES|beef:RARE BEEF|herbs:HERBS|lime:LIME|chili:CHILI" sub="a 45k bowl" final="45.000 ₫|lunch, sorted"
Broth simmered all night,
noodles,
rare beef,
herbs,
lime,
chili.
# w3 at=biahoi cam=push act=cheers time=night head="10.000 ₫|a glass of bia hơi"
At night, a plastic stool and a ten-thousand-dong beer.
# w3 at=money cam=orbit act=money time=night head="435.000 ₫|≈ $17 for the whole day"
The whole day, all in: about seventeen dollars.
